// Detection: D8 Security event log cleared
// ATT&CK: T1070.001 (Defense Evasion - Clear Windows Event Logs)
// Data source: SecurityEvent, EventID 1102 (audit log was cleared)
// Hypothesis: clearing the Security log is a common attempt to hide activity
// False positives: rare; planned log maintenance
// Tuning: usually none, treat every hit as high severity
// Note: the System log clear (EventID 104) is in the Event table, not SecurityEvent
let lookback = 24h;
SecurityEvent
| where TimeGenerated > ago(lookback)
| where EventID == 1102
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, ClearedBy = SubjectUserName, ClearedByDomain = SubjectDomainName
| sort by TimeGenerated desc
